Step 9: Configure Build Triggers (Webhook + Polling)
Option A: Generic Webhook Trigger (Recommended)
Under Build Triggers, check Generic Webhook Trigger

Token: my-secret-token

Option B: Poll SCM (Fallback)
Check Poll SCM

Schedule: H/2 * * * *

Step 10: Add Deployment Build Steps
Under Build, click Add build step > Execute shell

Copy and paste this script:

bash
# Copy all files to App Server 1 (disable host key checking)
scp -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no -r * sarah@stapp01:/tmp/

# Move files to web directory with sudo
ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no sarah@stapp01 "sudo rm -rf /var/www/html/* && sudo cp -r /tmp/* /var/www/html/"

# Set proper ownership
ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no sarah@stapp01 "sudo chown -R sarah:sarah /var/www/html/"

# Set correct permissions
ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no sarah@stapp01 "sudo chmod -R 755 /var/www/html/"

# Restart httpd
ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no sarah@stapp01 "sudo systemctl restart httpd"

# Clean up temporary files
ssh -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no sarah@stapp01 "sudo rm -rf /tmp/*"
