Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue	Solution
Host key verification failed	Use -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no in SCP/SSH commands
Permission denied	Run sudo chown -R sarah:sarah /var/www/html/
Webhook not triggering	Verify Target URL and token match Jenkins configuration
httpd not serving content	Check SELinux: sudo setenforce 0 (temporary)
SCP/SSH password prompt	Ensure credentials are properly configured in Jenkins

